---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Privacy Policy | Junaid Babu" 
    description="Privacy policy and data handling practices for Junaid Babu's educational applications and portfolio website."
    showAds={false}
>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 w-full">
        <h1 class="font-sans text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600">
            <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026</p>
            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">We do not fundamentally require or store personal user accounts for our basic applications. When interacting with applications like <strong>Phonics Buddy</strong>, all active microphone data processing fundamentally occurs 100% locally on your computer via the native Web Speech API. We do not transmit, record, or store children's voice recordings on our servers.</p>
            
            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">2. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">This website utilizes Google Analytics and Google AdSense. These third-party services use cookies to analyze site traffic, personalize content, and serve relevant advertisements based on prior visits globally across the internet.</p>

            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">3. Third-Party Links</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">Our portfolio occasionally links to external resources or Github repositories. We hold no responsibility for the privacy protocols of those external websites.</p>

            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">4. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you possess concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please refer to the <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 font-medium">Contact page</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
